eam/apps/1810630/extras/INTRO_STORY_GIF.gif?t=1740704666\" />Lokko and his brother Lokko Sr. run a small pizza shop called Lokko Pizza. They make the best pizzas in the world, and they hand deliver them smoking hot anywhere in the world.\u00a0Deliver pizzas all over the world to your hungry customers whether it\u2019s a sweet Hawaiian Surprise or a cheesy Sicilian Special.\u00a0However, in another part of town, the evil fast-food corporation lead by Goobol and his minions, try their best to stop Lokko from delivering pizza. Goobol is all about making\u00a0fast cheap terrible food.\u00a0By stopping Lokko, the world will have no choice but to eat their frozen processed food. Lokko will run, drive or teleport through space and time to get you a fresh wholesome pizza. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/Breakline_LOKKO_StorePage.png?t=1740704666\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/Breakline_PvP_EN.png?t=1740704666\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/extras/Multiplayer_PvP.gif?t=1740704666\" /><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Speed run against all challengers across all platforms. Load up their ghost sessions and compete in a global leader-boards to unlock special content such as bonus levels and gameplay modes</p>","developers":["Appy Monkeys Software Pvt. Ltd."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810630/header.jpg?t=1740704666","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257081522,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.a